#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:7
msgid "Newton Native Data and Selection API"
msgstr "Newton 原生数据与选择 API"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:10
msgid "Mental model"
msgstr "基本概念"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:12
msgid ""
"The Newton backend exposes its engine-owned `Model <https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/api/_generated/newton.Model.html>`_, `State "
"<https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/api/_generated/newton.State.html>`_, "
"`Control <https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/api/_generated/newton.Control.html>`_, and "
"optional ``Contacts`` objects through "
":class:`isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager`. Their Warp arrays are the "
"live engine data, rather than values pulled into a separate per-asset view "
"buffer. The model owns structural and static arrays and labels; a state owns"
" evolving simulation arrays; and a control owns actuation inputs. Contacts "
"are optional and depend on the active solver and collision path."
msgstr ""
"Newton 后端通过 :class:`isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` 暴露引擎持有的 `Model "
"<https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/api/_generated/newton.Model.html>`_ 、 `State"
" <https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/api/_generated/newton.State.html>`_ 、 "
"`Control <https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/api/_generated/newton.Control.html>`_ 和可选的 "
"``Contacts`` 对象。它们的 Warp "
"数组就是引擎实时数据，而非读取到单独的各资源视图缓冲区中的副本。模型持有结构、静态数组和标签，状态持有随仿真演化的数组，控制对象持有驱动输入。接触对象是可选的，取决于当前求解器和碰撞路径。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:23
msgid "Lifecycle prerequisite"
msgstr "生命周期前提"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:25
msgid ""
"Access Newton data after the simulation context has initialized the physics "
"backend and built its model. Treat the objects as invalid after a model "
"rebuild and reacquire them after Isaac Lab has reinitialized the simulation."
" This API is intended for code that can own the necessary lifecycle and "
"synchronization responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"在仿真上下文初始化物理后端并构建模型之后，才能访问 Newton 数据。模型重建后，应将现有对象视为失效，并在 Isaac Lab "
"重新初始化仿真后重新获取。此 API 面向能够承担必要生命周期管理和同步责任的代码。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:31
msgid "Reuse Isaac Lab-owned access"
msgstr "复用 Isaac Lab 持有的访问对象"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:33
msgid "Use the manager accessors to obtain the current Newton objects:"
msgstr "通过管理器访问器获取当前 Newton 对象："

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:47
msgid ""
":meth:`isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.get_model` can construct a "
"visualization shadow model when PhysX is active. The write semantics in this"
" guide apply only when Newton is the active, authoritative physics backend."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 处于活动状态时， :meth:`isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.get_model` "
"可以构建用于可视化的影子模型。本指南中的写入语义仅在 Newton 是当前实际负责物理仿真的后端时适用。"

