#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:61
msgid ""
"Newton uses this generic, label-based selection concept for Isaac Lab "
"articulations, rigid objects, rigid-object collections, and cables. It is a "
"selection helper over model indices, not per-asset typed storage."
msgstr ""
"Newton 对 Isaac Lab "
"关节体、刚体对象、刚体对象集合和线缆使用这一通用的基于标签的选择方式。它是模型索引上的选择辅助对象，不是各资源专用的类型化存储。"

