#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:80
msgid "Read/write semantics"
msgstr "读写语义"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:82
msgid ""
"Selections provide typed convenience methods as well as generic string-keyed"
" ``get_attribute()`` and ``set_attribute()`` methods. The generic methods "
"expose engine properties that do not have dedicated selection methods. Clone"
" a selected value before modifying it when you want the write to remain "
"explicit:"
msgstr ""
"选择对象既提供类型化便捷方法，也提供以字符串为键的通用 ``get_attribute()`` 和 ``set_attribute()`` "
"方法。通用方法暴露没有专门选择方法的引擎属性。如果希望写入保持显式，应先克隆选定的值，再进行修改："

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:104
msgid ""
"The string names a Newton model attribute rather than an Isaac Lab field. "
"This example uses rolling friction because it has no dedicated selection "
"method. Notify the manager with the flag appropriate to the property "
"changed; other model writes can require a different flag. State writes that "
"change generalized coordinates instead require forward-kinematics "
"synchronization through ``NewtonManager.invalidate_fk()`` and "
"``NewtonManager.forward()``."
msgstr ""
"字符串指定的是 Newton 模型属性，不是 Isaac Lab "
"字段。本例使用滚动摩擦，因为它没有专门的选择方法。根据修改的属性，使用适当的标志通知管理器；其他模型写入可能需要不同标志。如果状态写入改变广义坐标，则需要通过"
" ``NewtonManager.invalidate_fk()`` 和 ``NewtonManager.forward()`` 同步正向运动学。"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:112
msgid "Ownership, synchronization, and invalidation"
msgstr "所有权、同步与失效"

#: source/concepts/native-physics-api/newton.rst:114
msgid ""
"Direct writes bypass Isaac Lab caches and shape/order validation. Some "
"Newton solvers swap current and next state buffers, so reacquire "
":meth:`isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.get_state_0` when code needs "
"the current authoritative state on a later step. A selection can survive "
"state-buffer swaps because it describes model indices, but it must be "
"recreated after a model rebuild. Solver-specific generalized- and maximal-"
"coordinate conventions remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"直接写入会绕过 Isaac Lab 缓存，以及形状与顺序验证。部分 Newton "
"求解器会交换当前与下一状态缓冲区，因此后续步中需要当前实际状态时，应重新调用 "
":meth:`isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager.get_state_0` "
"。选择对象描述模型索引，所以可以跨状态缓冲区交换继续使用，但模型重建后必须重新创建。广义坐标和最大坐标的约定仍以具体求解器为准。"

